  "description": "Ha Jung-Min, an ordinary man in his thirties with neither money nor hope, finds himself at the very bottom of misfortune after a car accident leaves him able to see only “male ghosts.” But they say you should turn a crisis into an opportunity. Just as he’s making a name for himself by helping many tormented male ghosts find peace through him body, he runs into Kang Seung-Hyeok, his high school crush. And it’s all part of his “exorcism business”! But...\n\n# Ghost A: I want love-filled sex that we both want, darling.\n\\# Ghost B: Ooooh~ Mommy, I’m sooo thirsty~ ahh♥\n\nMy first love died as of today.\n\n(Source: MrBlue, translated)",
